# Byte-stable basis for the melatonin analytic fixtures.
#
# The fixture digests recorded in the task evidence and in
# docs/module-decoupling-validation.md are SHA-256 digests over the LF bytes
# produced by the generator.  Without this guarantee a Windows checkout would
# translate the line endings and the recorded digests would no longer describe
# the bytes on disk.  Same discipline as the pinned production source under
# app/sleep_model/sources/** (text eol=lf).
* text eol=lf
